What is it?
-----------

TEMPerature V1.3 [26-OCT-1997] PostCard Ware. Add this ARexx program to your
bbsmenu ie. TEMPerature | {q#0Doors:TEMPerature} and let your users convert
between Celsius, Kelvin and Fahrenheit.

As always, Use at your own risk. It works great here but may bomb
elsewhere.

Installation:
-------------

Read History.Doc for past version notes.


1. Unarch the program :) Lets hope this part is already done.
2. Move the TEMPerature.rexx program to Doors/PFiles (or anywhere)
3. Add this line to your bbsmenu file or as a pfile/door:
   TEMPerature | {#0DOORS:TEMPerature}
                 ^
                 Remember that the { is a CTRL-Q character
4. Save :)

Thats it! Simple.

